## 4. Logo Rules

- **Never recreate the logo in CSS, SVG code, or any other medium** — handcrafted reproductions drift from the approved wordmark geometry and create trademark risk.
- Always use: `<img src="/lazboy-logo.png" alt="La-Z-Boy" />`
- Download official logo: https://brandguidelines.la-z-boy.com/89f81758c/p/73dcba-primary-logo
- Save as `lazboy-logo.png` in the project's `public/` or `static/` directory
- On dark backgrounds: `filter: brightness(0) invert(1)` (CSS) or Tailwind `brightness-0 invert`
- Minimum size: 72px wide (digital) / 1 inch (print)
- Recommended: header `h-10` (40px), footer `h-8` (32px)
- Clearspace: equal to the height of the "L" on all sides
- One-color variants (Comfort Blue or Black) when full color isn't available

### Tagline
Only approved form: `Live life comfortably.®`
- Always include `®` symbol
- Sentence case only — never ALL CAPS or altered wording

